# Svgbob ASCII diagrams
	: fname=svgbob.jpg notitle theme=github-light
	# Standalone diagram
		: svgbob
		:
		: +---------+     +----------+
		: | outline |---->| renderer |
		: +---------+     +----------+
	# Diagram inside Markdown
		: md noheader md_wrap=off ctrans
		:
		: ### Local rendering pipeline
		:
		: ```svgbob
		: +-------+     +-----+     +-----+
		: | ASCII |---->| SVG |---->| PNG |
		: +-------+     +-----+     +-----+
		: ```
		:
		: Source spacing is preserved; the node grows to fit the diagram.
	# Application architecture
		: svgbob svgbob_stroke_width=1.5 fg="#334155"
		:
		: +---------------+       +---------------+       +---------------+
		: |    Clients    |------>|  API gateway  |------>|  Application  |
		: +---------------+       +---------------+       +-------+-------+
		:                                                         |
		:                                 +-----------------------+-----------------------+
		:                                 |                       |                       |
		:                                 v                       v                       v
		:                         +---------------+       +---------------+       +---------------+
		:                         |     Cache     |       |    Database   |       |   Job queue   |
		:                         +---------------+       +---------------+       +-------+-------+
		:                                                                                 |
		:                                                                                 v
		:                                                                         +---------------+
		:                                                                         |    Workers    |
		:                                                                         +-------+-------+
		:                                                                                 |
		:                                                                                 v
		:                                                                         +---------------+
		:                                                                         |   Audit log   |
		:                                                                         +---------------+
	# Architecture notes
		: md noheader mdw=400
		: ### Request processing
		:
		: 1. Clients reach the application through an API gateway.
		: 2. Requests can use the cache, database, or background job queue.
		: 3. Workers consume queued jobs and write an audit log.
		:
		: The diagram uses `svgbob_stroke_width=1.5` and an explicit foreground color.
		: All diagram lines retain their natural size.
